    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeons &amp; Dimensions is an Exploration Coop Action RPG Game with Souls-like Combat Inspirations.\u200b</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/5c7054f8dac050549bff60a63f0a90e1.poster.avif?t=1741291425\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/5c7054f8dac050549bff60a63f0a90e1.webm?t=1741291425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/5c7054f8dac050549bff60a63f0a90e1.mp4?t=1741291425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Embark on a Journey Across Strange Worlds</strong><br>Step into the unknown as you find yourself transported to mysterious and diverse realms. Each world presents unique challenges and hidden treasures waiting to be discovered.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/ffa7dbdc6467557ba79e2188c78c10c9.poster.avif?t=1741291425\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/ffa7dbdc6467557ba79e2188c78c10c9.webm?t=1741291425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/extras/ffa7dbdc6467557ba79e2188c78c10c9.mp4?t=1741291425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore and Survive</strong><br>Embark into randomly generated worlds, where every corner hides deadly challenges and priceless treasures. With the intensity of Souls-like combat, every step is crucial in your quest for survival. Face the daunting challenges that lie ahead, explore relentlessly, and emerge unscathed!<br><br><s